# Visual-verification scratch output (#657). Playwright MCP writes page snapshots
# into .playwright-mcp/ and screenshots into the repo ROOT, and both were reachable
# by a broad `git add`: three snapshots ended up tracked (so tidying the folder
# deleted tracked files), and degraded-banner-356.png was swept into a commit about
# code-node error classification, referenced by nothing.
#
# The PNG rule is anchored to the root on purpose. Real images live in
# apps/web/public/ and must stay tracked.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
supabase-ops/supabase/.temp/
